  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:0",
      "text": "Morning. Main thing today is the billing email templates. Tomasz, where did we land with the rendering bug?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:1",
      "text": "Fixed on Monday. Outlook was stripping the header table, so I rebuilt it with plain divs. It renders fine in all the test inboxes now."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:2",
      "text": "Nice. Did that cover the dark mode version too?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:3",
      "text": "Mostly. The logo still looks muddy on a black background. I've asked design for a light variant."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:4",
      "text": "OK. What's left before we can switch every customer over to the new templates?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:5",
      "text": "Three templates. The invoice, the failed payment one, and the receipt. Receipts are the hard part because of the tax lines per country."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:6",
      "text": "How many countries are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:7",
      "text": "Eleven with VAT, plus the US sales tax block. I want a snapshot test for each one."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:8",
      "text": "That's sensible. Any blockers?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:9",
      "text": "The tax copy. Finance still owes me the wording for reverse charge invoices."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:10",
      "text": "I'll chase finance today."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:11",
      "text": "From my side, the new templates are what the autumn campaign links to. The footer has the new referral block."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:12",
      "text": "Right. So let's aim for end of month for the full switch-over. Tomasz, does that work?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:13",
      "text": "End of month should be doable if finance gets back to me this week."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:14",
      "text": "OK, end of month. I'll plan around that."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:15",
      "text": "Good. Tomasz, can you also turn off the old templates once the switch is done, so we don't send both?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:16",
      "text": "Yes, I'll delete them from the sender config after a day of clean sends."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:17",
      "text": "One more thing. Can we get a preview link for the referral block? Legal wants to read the terms in context."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:18",
      "text": "I'll send one this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:19",
      "text": "Thanks. The campaign copy is with the translators, so I can't change the referral wording after this week."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-end-of-month:seg:20",
      "text": "Noted. Let's keep that wording frozen, then. Thanks, both."
    }
  ],
