    "proseDraft": "It was confirmed that the switch will be done around the end of the month, though the recheck was not conclusive. The other points about the old templates, the referral block preview and wording, the reverse charge wording, and the logo were only stated and remain open.\n\nConfirmed by participants\n- It was confirmed by Hannah, Tomasz and Aiko that the switch will be done around the end of the month, though the recheck was not conclusive.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- It was stated that the full switch-over should be aimed for the end of the month.\n- It was stated that the speaker would plan around the end of the month.\n- It was stated that the end of the month should be doable if finance gets back this week.\n- It was stated that the speaker would chase finance today.\n- It was stated as a request to Tomasz to turn off the old templates once the switch is done so both are not sent.\n- It was stated that the speaker would delete them from the sender config after a day of clean sends.\n- It was stated as a request for a preview link for the referral block.\n- It was stated that the speaker would send one this afternoon.\n- It was stated that the speaker cannot change the referral wording after this week.\n- It was stated that that wording should be kept frozen.\n- It was stated that finance still owes the wording for reverse charge invoices.\n- It was stated that the logo still looks muddy on a black background.\n- It was stated that the speaker has asked design for a light variant."
